<title>NETHERLANDS: ABN AMRO details interim stock dividend.</title>
<headline>ABN AMRO details interim stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch bank ABN AMRO NV said on Friday its alternative interim stock dividend for 1996 would be worth 1.75 guilders, based on Friday's share price.</p>
<p>Shareholders can opt for one new share for every 53 shares held, which, based on an average share price on Friday of 92.75 guilders, made it worth 1.75 guilders, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>In August, ABN AMRO said it had raised its interim cash dividend by 0.20 guilders to 1.80.</p>
<p>--Amsterdam Newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
</text>
